      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Get Templates emits 7 rows. Without this, the next Sheets node runs\n7x and returns every Cold Mailing row 7 times (7 x 6 = 42 items).\nClassify Rows still sees all 7 templates via $('Get Templates').all()."
