    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Status state machine\n\n**Pending** -> draft cold mail + resume -> `Sent` (writes ThreadId + Timestamp)\n\n**Sent** -> after **4 days** -> `Ready for Followup`\n\n**Ready for Followup** -> *ignored on purpose.* This is your manual gate — flip it to `FollowUp` yourself to authorise the followup.\n\n**FollowUp** -> threaded reply, no resume -> `FollowUp Sent`\n\n**FollowUp Sent** -> after **5 days** -> `Ready for Followup` (loops back through your gate)",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "d5154911-60fc-4195-bab1-87778206c534",
      "name": "Sticky Note 8686",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        816,
        352
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## The TemplateId column picks the template\n\nIt holds a **TemplateName** (`Recruiter Mail`, `Follow-Up 1`, `Follow-Up 2 (Final)`) — matched against the Templates tab.\n\nThis drives **both** the cold mail and the followup. Want the 2nd followup to read differently? Set TemplateId to `Follow-Up 2 (Final)` on that row before you flip Status to `FollowUp`.\n\nA template whose Body is empty is **skipped**, never drafted blank.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "eccc928f-f377-46e5-a53c-28add9797cde",
      "name": "Sticky Note 8319",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1296,
        352
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Drafts only\n\nNothing is ever sent. Rows are marked `Sent` at **draft** time, so the 4-day clock starts when the draft is made, not when you actually send it.\n\nSend the drafts from Gmail yourself.\n\n**Setup:** pick a Gmail credential on both Gmail nodes; format **Timestamp** as Plain text; make sure Sheets/Drive creds are on `mahir2cool@gmail.com`.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "1b7c04a1-d5aa-4eb6-9554-4d6bad292602",
      "name": "Sticky Note aabf",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1712,
        352
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
